            <span class="mk">As of {M.int}</span>
            <p>In <span id="ex-d-m">–</span> the RBI's net purchases were <b id="ex-d-net">–</b>. Over the last twelve months it bought <b id="ex-d-bought12">–</b> and sold <b id="ex-d-sold12">–</b>. Its forward book stood at <b id="ex-d-fw">–</b>; the deepest point in the series is <b id="ex-d-fwt">–</b>. Of the current book, a net <b id="ex-d-1m">–</b> falls due within a month.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </figure>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- § 10 what India owes: external-debt-annual, external-debt-sector-inr, external-iip-head, external-nri -->
